WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:19.708 --> 00:00:21.041
Well, look who it is

00:00:21.041 --> 00:00:22.833
the Brow...and the Foul

00:00:24.291 --> 00:00:26.541
Just ignore them. They’re trying to get under your skin

00:00:26.541 --> 00:00:28.250
Aww...how cute is that, Enes

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:28.750
Look at them

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:31.166
They’re like closer than his eyebrows!

00:00:32.125 --> 00:00:35.375
Looks like Boogie Cousins has a Boogie Brother

00:00:36.666 --> 00:00:37.958
I don’t know though, I’m a bit scared

00:00:37.958 --> 00:00:39.708
I mean, with this chemistry they’ve got?

00:00:39.708 --> 00:00:41.875
I think they’ve got a real shot at the 10th seed

00:00:41.875 --> 00:00:46.083
You know, you talk a lot for someone who has less rebounds than his point guard

00:00:46.083 --> 00:00:47.791
Keep your focus, DeMarcus

00:00:47.791 --> 00:00:50.833
If you get a technical, you’ll be suspended again

00:00:50.833 --> 00:00:52.583
I’m sorry. We’re being rude

00:00:52.583 --> 00:00:55.000
I’m actually a big admirer of your game

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:58.958
I love da move where you fake left, roll right, and then get ejected

00:00:59.791 --> 00:01:01.458
You know for being a big, whiney pu--

00:01:01.458 --> 00:01:04.625
I’ll knock that fancy little stache so far down your throat

00:01:04.625 --> 00:01:06.250
you’ll have a merkin on your entrails

00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:07.958
Hey hey! Stop it! Stop it! It’s not worth it!

00:01:09.041 --> 00:01:10.750
He’s right. Enough of this

00:01:10.750 --> 00:01:11.500
King of the Prairie!

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:12.250
King of the Prairie!

00:01:12.250 --> 00:01:14.833
While we’re bickering over eyebrows and mustaches,

00:01:14.833 --> 00:01:17.333
Golden State is marching towards the championship

00:01:17.833 --> 00:01:20.458
Save your energy for the real fight

00:01:20.458 --> 00:01:21.791
ARGH! FINE!

00:01:21.791 --> 00:01:23.375
To hell with Golden State!

00:01:24.208 --> 00:01:25.375
Technical foul!

00:01:25.375 --> 00:01:27.416
Oh, c’mon! You gotta be kiddin’ me, ref! For what?

00:01:28.083 --> 00:01:29.833
Uh, disembowelment of a referee

00:01:29.833 --> 00:01:32.166
which the league is sort of crackin’ down on now...

00:01:34.833 --> 00:01:37.166
Do you like it here...in Dallas?

00:01:37.166 --> 00:01:38.458
Very much so

00:01:38.458 --> 00:01:39.958
Better than Golden State?

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:43.750
Golden State is a ​very​ special place

00:01:43.750 --> 00:01:45.083
dear to my heart

00:01:45.083 --> 00:01:46.583
But I’m very happy here

00:01:46.583 --> 00:01:47.708
in my​ new ​home

00:01:47.708 --> 00:01:50.250
But don’t you miss being a contender?

00:01:50.250 --> 00:01:52.250
I have a much larger role here

00:01:52.250 --> 00:01:54.375
thanks to the graciousness of our Lord

00:01:54.375 --> 00:01:55.875
Ah! Nerlens!

00:01:55.875 --> 00:01:59.458
I almost didn’t recognize you without your cylindrical hair

00:01:59.458 --> 00:02:01.375
It is an honor to present my king

00:02:01.375 --> 00:02:03.291
Lord Mark of House Mavericks

00:02:03.291 --> 00:02:04.458
Kiss me, child

00:02:07.166 --> 00:02:08.416
Thank you, Harrison

00:02:08.416 --> 00:02:10.291
We’re delighted to have you here

00:02:10.291 --> 00:02:12.083
Please, sit!

00:02:12.333 --> 00:02:13.375
Would you like a rib?

00:02:13.708 --> 00:02:16.125
No thank you, I’m not very hungry

00:02:16.125 --> 00:02:20.541
Oh, child. You can’t come to Texas and not enjoy some ​barbeque​!

00:02:20.541 --> 00:02:21.541
Okay

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:26.333
You like the ribs?

00:02:26.333 --> 00:02:27.416
It’s very good

00:02:27.416 --> 00:02:28.625
They’re Chandler Parsons

00:02:30.083 --> 00:02:31.583
...favorite thing to eat when he was here

00:02:32.291 --> 00:02:33.291
Oh, you must be thirsty

00:02:34.083 --> 00:02:35.000
Where’s the sweet tea?

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:36.041
WHERE’S THE SWEET TEA?

00:02:36.583 --> 00:02:38.583
Well don’t just stand there, you imbecile!

00:02:38.583 --> 00:02:39.833
Get the DAMN sweet tea!

00:02:43.666 --> 00:02:47.500
Now, I know things were...difficult for you in Philadelphia

00:02:48.458 --> 00:02:50.791
I’m very grateful for my time at House Sixers--

00:02:50.791 --> 00:02:51.666
Oh, stop it

00:02:51.666 --> 00:02:54.500
It’s ​dreadful​ in that chamber pot of a franchise

00:02:54.750 --> 00:02:56.000
Now, come on

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:57.666
you can be honest with me

00:02:57.666 --> 00:02:59.916
I’m not like those other owners, you know

00:02:59.916 --> 00:03:02.000
I’m a cool guy

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:03.458
Just a normal

00:03:03.458 --> 00:03:04.583
cool

00:03:04.583 --> 00:03:05.416
guy

00:03:06.333 --> 00:03:06.958
Noted

00:03:07.791 --> 00:03:10.041
Well, if I’m being honest

00:03:10.041 --> 00:03:12.666
there were a lot of centers and not enough minutes

00:03:13.541 --> 00:03:15.208
Frankly, I was very sick of losing

00:03:15.208 --> 00:03:16.875
There there, child!

00:03:16.875 --> 00:03:18.833
There’s no need to worry anymore

00:03:18.833 --> 00:03:20.958
Here in Dallas, we ​never​ tank

00:03:21.541 --> 00:03:22.541
Now, chin up!

00:03:22.541 --> 00:03:24.500
Aren’t you excited to play with Dirk?

00:03:24.500 --> 00:03:26.041
Oh yes, he’s...very good

00:03:26.041 --> 00:03:27.458
He’s the greatest

00:03:27.458 --> 00:03:29.083
Yeah...he’s great

00:03:29.083 --> 00:03:31.291
The greatest

00:03:31.291 --> 00:03:33.000
The...greatest

00:03:33.416 --> 00:03:34.416
You see, Nerlens

00:03:34.416 --> 00:03:38.458
I personally ensure that no one makes light of my Mavericks

00:03:39.208 --> 00:03:40.125
Or else...

00:03:40.833 --> 00:03:42.208
Or else...what?

00:03:44.333 --> 00:03:45.500
Ah! My sweet tea!

